{"id":"658939","name":"卤肉饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658939/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五花肉洗净去皮。","img":"images/658939/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"改刀切小块。","img":"images/658939/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜片，八角，桂皮，香叶备用。","img":"images/658939/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鹌鹑蛋煮熟去壳备用。","img":"images/658939/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入香料炒香。","img":"images/658939/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入五花肉翻炒。","img":"images/658939/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煸炒出油脂。","img":"images/658939/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/658939/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/658939/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/658939/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"转入珐琅锅里。","img":"images/658939/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盖上煮开转小火焖30分钟。","img":"images/658939/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"分钟后放入鹌鹑蛋，继续焖煮15分钟收汁即可。","img":"images/658939/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658939/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658939/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}